# Third-party notices

This repository is the PI-Desktop port of the ThinkRail workflow system. Parts of
it are derived from other open-source projects; the license text that governs a
part stays with that part (or is named below).

## JetBrains/thinkrail -- MIT

<https://github.com/JetBrains/thinkrail>

- `packages/pi-thinkrail-workflow/skills/**` (the 10 workflow skills, the family
  meta-layer) and `packages/spec-graph/skills/spec-graph/SKILL.md` are ported
  into `plugins/pi.thinkrail/skills/**`. Every ported skill file carries a
  Chinese provenance line naming its upstream path and license at the top.
- The meta-layer (concept model, skill roles, the 15 meta-rules) is folded into
  `plugins/pi.thinkrail/skills/writing-workflow-skills.md`, because this host
  reads exactly one file per skill.
- The two always-on rules this plugin restates come from
  `packages/pi-thinkrail-workflow/index.ts` (`WORKFLOW_RULE`) and
  `packages/spec-graph/index.ts` (`SPEC_RULE`).

## dsh-plugin-thinkrail -- MIT

The immediate predecessor this port was built from (`goal-and-requirements.md`
names it as `../dshthinkrailspec`), itself a port of JetBrains/thinkrail.

